"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Explore."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:32
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:36
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OE_ACID\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:65
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OE_ACID_CLEARING\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:70
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_CLEARING\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"Its unusual for the Acidic Growth to be found outside of their nebulae. "
"However, it appears to have decided you're a threat and is moving in to "
"attack!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:71
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_CLEARING\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"The ship at this beacon is of Acidic Growth origin. It's unclear what "
"they're doing outside a nebula: reconnaissance, or just lost? You don't get "
"to ask them though, since their weapons are online and charging!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:78
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OE_ACID_PIRATE_CLEARING\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:83
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_PIRATE_CLEARING\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"There appears to be a pirate ship nearby. Be on your guard; anyone trying to"
" hunt in Acidic territory is either formidable or deeply stupid, and in "
"space, either can be dangerous."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:84
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_PIRATE_CLEARING\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"\"We knew anyone foolish enough to try and sneak through an Acidic nebula "
"would stick to open space. Yield your goods, and we may let you live.\" You "
"cut the transmission in lieu of a response."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:85
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_PIRATE_CLEARING\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"Before you can take a moment's rest from the ever-present nebulas in this "
"sector, a pirate ship appears behind you and opens fire."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:92
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OE_ACID_REBEL_CLEARING\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:97
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_REBEL_CLEARING\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"As you arrive at the beacon, a hostile ship immediately registers on your "
"scanners. You didn't expect to see Rebels extending their reach into the "
"unknown regions of Acidic territory. Charge the weapons!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:98
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_REBEL_CLEARING\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You jump into empty space and are relieved to see your sensors blink back to"
" life. However, you are less pleased to see them immediately register a "
"Rebel ship on an approach vector!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:99
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_REBEL_CLEARING\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You receive a message from a nearby ship, \"Looks like our intelligence was "
"correct! You can't escape us by traveling into unknown territory... No one "
"can hide from the Rebellion!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:103
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OE_ACID_ORCHID_CLEARING\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"From what you remember, Gathering-Growth Alliance formed from initiative of "
"Caretakers after Acidic Growth was discovered. Orchids you meet at this "
"beacon, however, are not as peaceful as those, and decide to remove you for "
"trespassing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:106
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OE_ACID_ORCHID_CLEARING\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:115
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OE_ACID_COALITION_CLEARING\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:120
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_COALITION_CLEARING\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"Knowing Acidic Growth are hidden away in nebulae, Coalition unsurprisingly "
"took interest in their sectors. This ship seems to be scouting territory, "
"but when it notices you it attacks."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:121
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_COALITION_CLEARING\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"\"You Fed dumb! Thought to moving outside acid? We waiting! Our space!\" "
"It's not theirs, but arguing with Coalition would be like talking to a brick"
" wall."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:122
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_OE_ACID_COALITION_CLEARING\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"Coalition is the enemy of many, including Acidic Growth and Orchids "
"occupying this sector... But now, it seems, it chose to be an enemy to "
"specifically you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:134
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_REFUGEE_OE_ACID_MV\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have encountered a refugee ship drifting in space. It looks as if it was"
" fleeing the Rebel advance and ran out of fuel. Its distress beacon is "
"active, but you're not sure anyone is on board."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:136
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_REFUGEE_OE_ACID_MV\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hail them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:140
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_REFUGEE_OE_ACID_MV\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Ignore the refugees."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:142
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_REFUGEE_OE_ACID_MV\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You're wary of the refugees but figure it's safe to do something on the "
"ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:144
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_REFUGEE_OE_ACID_MV\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:148
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_REFUGEE_OE_ACID_MV\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:157
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"REFUGEE_HAIL_LIST_OE_ACID_MV\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"As you hail the refugee ship, an Acidic ship jumps into the system... it was"
" chasing it off its territory, and now it has found you instead!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:160
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"REFUGEE_HAIL_LIST_OE_ACID_MV\"]/event[2]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:167
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The distress call appears to be emanating from a Slug ship caught in open "
"space by an Acidic vessel. They contact you on emergency frequencies: "
"\"Pleassse, we'll give you all we have if you sssave ussss!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:169
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack the Acidic ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:171
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You lock onto the Acidic ship and engage."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:174
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:180
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Attack the Slug ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:182
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You move to finish what the Acidic Growth has started."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:185
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:191
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Leave the Acidic Growth to its prize. Power up the jump drive."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:193
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You would think that the slug's greed would end at the Acidic Growth's "
"borders, but apparently not."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:195
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:199
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_MANTIS_MV\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:207
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ACIDIC_SURRENDER\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"It doesn't look like they can stand much more damage. After a few shots, "
"their ship breaks apart, and you move in to loot the remains."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:211
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ACIDIC_SURRENDER\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Slug captain hails you: \"A missstake! A sssimple misstake. Of courssse "
"we can pay you! Ssseee? An augmentation has already been transssported.\" "
"You allow them to leave with their lives."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:217
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"It seems like an Acidic Growth ship, likely a scout, is at this beacon. They"
" don't seem hostile, despite noticing you the moment you jumped in. \"You, "
"outsider. Growth, expands. Sent, on a mission, to survey. Map data, you "
"have?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:220
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack them!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:222
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship is confused, but not unprepared. It seems like they're "
"trying to retreat back into the nebula!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:228
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[@req=\"sensors\"]/text"
msgstr "(Advanced Sensors) Share the data you collected."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:232
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[@req=\"ADV_SCANNERS\"]/text"
msgstr "(Long-Ranged Scanners) Share the data you collected."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:236
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "We don't."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:238
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[4]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Acidic Growth ends comms and continues on. You have some time to yourself."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:240
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[4]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:244
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING\"]/choice[4]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:251
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SCOUT_CLEARING_REWARD\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic vessel thanks you for the data and transports over some scrap as "
"thanks."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:294
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_HIGH_PRICE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"A large Acidic vessel is sitting dormant. After a moment, it hails you, "
"offering the services of one of them in return for scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:298
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_HIGH_PRICE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept the offer."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:300
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_HIGH_PRICE\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You send over your scrap, and shortly thereafter a strange drone with a "
"glass dome teleports onto your ship. It appears that's how Acidic Growth "
"transports itself."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:304
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_HIGH_PRICE\"]/choice[1]/event/crewMember"
