#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:377
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_MYSTERIOUS_TECH_PURCHASE\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Enjoy! And remember, no refundsss!\" The Slugs beam after having installed"
" a strange red button on your ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:384
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_MYSTERIOUS_TECH_PURCHASE\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"Even though you paid the money to the Slugs, you're surprised when you find "
"they have actually upgraded your reactor, without any tricks!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:393
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_GUN_UPGRADE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You're hailed by an Acidic ship, \"Outsider. Tests, we wish to perform. "
"Weapon, can you donate? Combine technology, we will. Combined, we will "
"return.\" You can probably get Acidic technology here, if you have the right"
" weapon."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:396
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_GUN_UPGRADE\"]/choice[@req=\"LASER_BURST_1\"]/text"
