msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_PRAETOR_DIPLOMATIC\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"They accept the hail, and an annoyed Praetor appears on your screen. "
"\"Federation? Didn't expect you here. Acidic space is dangerous for you... "
"But i fear you don't care, considering you decided to stay at this beacon "
"and let it devour you.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:1505
