#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:1507
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_PRAETOR_DIPLOMATIC\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The orchid stutters, \"We... we produce... Whatever, it doesn't matter. The "
"difference is, we're on a mission. A mission that you distract us from. I "
"suggest you move on. Your ship will thank you.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:1509
