"yes? Please excuse him, we're all a little bit riled up. You see, we were "
"sent on a diplomatic mission to further relationship between the Gathering "
"and Acidic Growth. The coordinates led us here, and we believe they were "
"correct... but we're just a little bit stuck.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:1513
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_PRAETOR_DIPLOMATIC\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Correct? There's nothing but the nebula."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:1515
