"An Orchid station is at this beacon, and you're being contacted - but not by"
" them. \"Outsider, finally. Hope, restored. Help?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2052
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Respond to the Acidic ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2054
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You inquire on what \"help\" means. \"Orchids, allies - but take us. More "
"than was agreed on. Didn't listen. Negotiation, possible? We want us back.\""
" It seems like Orchids took a substantial mass of Acidic Growth and hold it "
"at the station, but why?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2056
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Agree to help and contact the station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2059
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Federation? What are you doing here?\" A disheveled Orchid asks. You can "
"see several other Orchids walking behind this one, and the whole place seems"
" rather sterile..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2061
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "What are YOU doing here?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2063
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Orchid is not amused. \"This is a research station, sanctioned by the "
"Council. Topic of research: Acidic Growth and its interaction with grown "
"weapons and ships; fertilizer efficiency enhancement. This was in agreement "
"with Growth itself, by the way. Now that your curiosity is satisfied, I hope"
" we can part ways?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2065
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "They said they did not agree to that amount."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2067
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Yes, we know. But with the impending threat of the Rebellion, we can't "
"afford working slow. And asking the Core about this, well, will take days.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2069
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Demand they release the Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2071
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"And why should we do that? Listen, even if the research wasn't objectively"
" for the best of both the Gathering and the Growth, we can't go against "
"higher-ups.\" It doesn't seem like they plan to give it up willingly."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2073
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2076
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You power up your weapons. The station responds, doing the same. Maybe if "
"you make them surrender, they'll release the Growth?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2078
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2084
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/text"
msgstr "(Praetor Crew) We ARE the higher-ups."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2086
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Orchid stutters. Now stuck between a rock and hard place, they decide it"
" isn't worth the trouble holding onto Acidic Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2088
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2090
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"While the Orchid station transports all the tanks of Growth back to the "
"Acidic ship, the latter contacts you again. \"Outsider, gratitude. Orchids -"
" allies. You - ally. Future negotiation, with allies, possible. Accept "
"this.\" Acidic Workers carry over a large amount of scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2098
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Back down."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2100
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You decide this isn't worth it. And, isn't it for the good of everyone? You "
"get ready to jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2106
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Part ways, as suggested."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2108
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The last thing you want to do is piss off your allies. You get ready to "
"jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2118
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Attack the Acidic ship instead."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2120
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You don't really know why Orchids would do something like this, but it must "
"be justified. You decide to help them by getting rid of Acidic Growth "
"pestering them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2126
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Close the comms and move on."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2128
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You don't really know why Orchids would do something like this, and don't "
"really care. You can do something aboard the ship, as long as you keep your "
"distance from both the Acidic ship and Orchid station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2130
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2134
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2146
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_WARNING\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As you jump to the beacon, an Acidic ship greets you with its weapons "
"online! However, instead of immediately attacking, the Growth hails you, "
"\"Outsider. Our territory. Leave, now.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2148
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_WARNING\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2150
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_WARNING\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Who do they think they are? Yes, maybe it's \"their\" space, but they can't "
"order you like that! You prepare to deal with them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2156
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_WARNING\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Leave as suggested."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2158
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_WARNING\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide to not upset the Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2165
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"This beacon hosts an unusual sight: a Federation ship on one side, Orchid "
"and Growth on the other, and a Smuggler vessel between them. There seems to "
"be active chatter on the comms."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2167
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Tap in."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2169
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"No, these guys are ours. They are registered in a nearby Federation-controlled sector - we've got their IDs and everything.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Federation, as per our alliance, I won't chase you away. However, this is Acidic Growth space. You're not an authority here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Why are you even speaking on their behalf? They can talk, right? Let them express themselves!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2175
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "What is going on here?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2177
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Federation captain doesn't take long to respond. \"Oh, sorry... didn't notice you were here. We've been tracking these Smugglers for a while, but had failed to really apprehend them until just now. According to this Orchid, though, there's some problem with us doing our jobs in Acidic space. My question is... why does it matter WHERE we catch these guys? Is the Growth in the business of harboring criminals?\"\n"
"\n"
"He looks over at another screen for any semblance of an explanation from the Growth ship, but the Acidic Worker present doesn't so much as shift. With a roll of his eyes, the captain looks back at you, \"Honestly, I'm not even sure that this stuff is sentient.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2181
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2183
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"An uncharacteristic anger coats the Orchid's words, as they snap back at the other captain, \"Do you even hear yourself right now? If you weren't flying Federation colors, I would be sure that I was talking to a Rebel. Yes, the Growth is sentient... and NO, they are not harboring criminals! As I've tried to explain, this simply isn't Federation space. It's not your job to handle any illicit dealings here!\"\n"
"\n"
"Tired with the conversation himself, the Federation captain merely gives the Orchid an unamused look. \"Trust me, I'm hearing myself just fine. Who I'd like to hear from, though, is the Growth - not some temperamental interpreter.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2187
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "We can resolve this."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2189
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You can?\" The Federation captain scrutinizes you, seemingly forgetting about the Growth. \"You don't look like one to care about the law... But you're a neutral party, and, frankly, the faster we move on from this, the better.\" His eyes move to a screen with the Orchid. \"Do you agree?\" \n"
"\n"
"The Orchid huffs with annoyance, \"If that means I never have to talk to you again, then sure. Renegade, what do you have to say?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2193
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "The Federation captain is right; they should apprehend the criminal."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2195
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"When the Orchid captain hears you, they close comms and jump away. The "
"Federation captain sighs, \"Well, good thing they decided to move their "
"temper tantrum elsewhere. I thank you for choosing reason; we'll arrest the "
"Smugglers immediately. I know that it's not exactly legal, but I want you to"
" have a weapon from their stores, as a gesture of gratitude. It's Acidic-"
"made, I think. They might be barely sentient by most standards, but if "
"there's something I could give these guys, it's that they're really good at "
"making weapons.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2201
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Orchid captain is right; Acidic Growth should decide by themselves."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2204
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Orchid captain is relieved, \"Yes! Yes! I'm glad at least SOME Federation personnel still hasn't tumbled down into a pit of xenophobia. You, captain, should know; you just witnessed how Federation rots from the inside, becoming not unli-\" He is interrupted by a grumbling voice, \"Fine, fine. I concede. The Growth shall now do whatever it wants with them, and we're leaving.\" The Federation ship jumps away. \n"
"\n"
"Orchids are delighted and gift you a little bit of scrap for standing with them. After a minute or so of Orchids talking to Growth on a private channel, they leave too."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2212
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Silently blow up the criminals' ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2214
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Deciding not to say anything, you fire on the Smuggler vessel - obliterating it in mere seconds. The captains of both ships are flabbergasted.\n"
"\n"
"\"What? But... you said... actually, you know what? I don't care - I'm done here.\" The Federation vessel jumps away.\n"
"\n"
"The Orchid captain, having been at a loss for words, then briefly says \"Yeah, alright. Sure.\" and leaves the beacon as well - the Acidic Growth following close behind them.\n"
"\n"
"You are now, finally, left alone... well, better than that, even: you've been left with a wreck to salvage!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2227
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Leave while the Growth has all of the attention."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2229
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"This situation sure is crazy, but you can't stay here for long because of "
"the constant danger of the approaching fleet. Besides, it's not like you're "
"knowledgeable on matters of law - if you were, maybe you wouldn't be "
"breaking them so often."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2239
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Not getting involved."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2241
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide it isn't worth your time."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2243
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2247
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2255
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"...You get contacted. \"Resolver, yes? This, criminals? We don't know what "
"to do with them.\" It's Acidic Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2257
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "You don't know? What was that whole show about then?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2259
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Orchids, allies. Didn't ask. Kept insisting. We didn't know what to say.\""
" The Worker on screen keeps standing still. You should probably come up with"
" the pirates' fate, because waiting for Growth will only make the Rebel "
"fleet closer."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2261
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Arrest them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2263
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "\"You suggest, workers? Crew? Gratitude. Accept, one of them.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2268
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Explode them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2270
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "\"You suggest, scrap? Resources? Gratitude. Accept, this part.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2275
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Let them go."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2277
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_ARREST_GROWTH\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You suggest, leave them? Gratitude.\" The Acidic ship jumps away, and the "
"Smugglers contact you, \"Can't believe we're out of this! Thanks, whoever "
"you are. We were trying to sell Acidic weapons over at Federation market, "
"but got caught. You can have one of those. We will make ourselves sparse, "
"now.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2289
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon just as a large Acidic vessel is preparing to "
"leave. After noticing you, they quickly stop charging their drive and "
"approach."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2291
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2293
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"As the ship gets closer, a curious detail pops up - crudely applied pirate "
"markings indicating their allegiance to the \"Fleet of the Piracy\". The "
"vessel hails you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2296
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hear them out."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2298
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Captain and/or autonomous piloting system. Your treasure, set to be "
"surrendered.\" The ship powers weapons. \"Commence, boarding preparations. "
"Otherwise, no mercy.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2300
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Prepare to be boarded."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2302
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You open the airlocks and allow the Acidic shuttle to dock. From it, a small"
" Acidic soldier enters your ship and, completely ignoring you, rushes for "
"the piloting. You give chase."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2304
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2306
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Running into the cockpit, you watch as the Acidic soldier awkwardly jumps up"
" and inserts a universal parallel transmission connector into the universal "
"serial transmission port on your control panel and stares at it in "
"confusion."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2308
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "W... what are you doing?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2312
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Wrong port, buddy."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2314
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic soldier turns to you, back to the failed connection, and back to you again. \n"
"\n"
"\"Tremble. Piracy victim. No treasure safe.\" \n"
"\n"
"You ask the soldier whether or not it understands what it's trying to do."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2320
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2330
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Fight back."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2332
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "There's no way you're allowing that."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2335
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2343
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "No mercy for the pirate folk, attack!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2345
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "The Acidic ship responds in kind."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2348
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2358
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"The vessel. Proud, piracy ship. Stealing treasure,\" It readjusts the connector. \"Greatest treasure. Proprietary systems.\" The soldier takes a few steps towards you.\n"
"\n"
"\"Slug. Not long before. Software acquisition proposition. Software found freely available. Was informed that is piracy.\" The lifeless suit looks almost sad. \"My existence now. Pirating software.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2362
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Inform the Growth about the misunderstanding."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2364
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You spend a good two hours passionately explaining to the Growth the "
"difference between different kinds of piracy, why software as a subscription"
" service is evil, and why using an adblocker on slug networks is less of a "
"crime and more of a necessity."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2366
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2368
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Information acknowledged.\" The Growth thinks for a moment. \"Will now engage in murder and plundering instead. No one shall be spared. You, exception.\" \n"
"\n"
"Before you manage to explain that that's not what you meant, the Soldier rushes off your ship towards its new, more lethal life, but not before leaving a small gift in the form of a thumb drive containing cracked copies of multiple applications known for their extreme anti-piracy protection. Such a find can be worth some good money."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2377
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Surrender your software and wish the Growth best of luck."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2379
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The soldier fixes its port mistake and copies some of the applications installed on your ship's consoles. You tell the Growth that it's doing a tremendous job being a pirate, absolutely tremendous, and wish it the best of luck cracking the applications. \n"
"\n"
"It returns back to its ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2383
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2385
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY_END\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Piracy, complete. Lack of resistance appreciated. Accept payment.\" \n"
"\n"
"The Growth transfers over some resources as payment for your data, and while that defeats the entire purpose of being a pirate, you know better than to reject a gift."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2414
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon to discover a Rock ship adrift at the beacon. It's "
"unusual to see the Rockmen out this far, and even more unusually this one "
"has ran out of fuel."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2418
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Supply them with fuel."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2420
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You hand over some of your fuel, The rockmen cautiously take the fuel before"
" repaying you with scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2428
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Attack them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2430
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You power on your weapons and engage the Rockmen."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2433
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2439
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Ignore them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2441
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "You fly away, leaving the Rock ship to their fate."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2443
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2447
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_ROCK\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2456
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_TRICK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find an Acidic vessel broadcasting the distress signal and contact them."
" \"Outsider. This is our space. Protect, we must.\" Apparently the Acidic "
"Growth has unexpectedly setup a trap for trespassers here."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2460
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_TRICK\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_oe_acid\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Positive Acidic Reputation) Explain that you're friendly with the Acidic "
"Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2463
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_TRICK\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_oe_acid\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"We didn't realize. Outsiders, not usually friends. Compensation, will be "
"given.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2468
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_TRICK\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Prepare for combat!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2475
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_QUESTION\"]/text"
