"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_QUESTION_LIST\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"The beacon's signal is deeper into the the nebula, as you track it you pass "
"by a pair of wrecks, both with strange burns along the sides."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2486
