#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2560
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_QUESTION_FALSE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Unfortunate. Outsider, wrong. Supplies, we will take. Mission, we must "
"complete.\" The Acidic Worker quickly beams aboard and takes some of your "
"supplies before you can react."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2568
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_QUESTION_TRUE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"The mission, complete. Nowhere to go, there is. We will join you on your "
"journey.\" The Acidic Worker beams aboard and joins your crew!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2569
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_QUESTION_TRUE\"]/crewMember"
msgstr "Acidic Worker"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2572
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_QUESTION_FAIL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"We... can not remember...\" The communications cut out and you're unable "
"to reacquire it. You decide to cut your losses and salvage some of the "
"wrecks while your jump drive charges."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2578
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You are surprised that the acidic ship, the origin of the distress signal, "
"hails you first. \"Outsider, we need help. Life support system, broken. "
"Reward promised\"."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2581
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Risk and send your crew over."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2585
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/choice[@req=\"BLUELIST_CREW_NO2\"]/text"
msgstr "(Anaerobic Crew) Don't risk and send your anaerobic crew."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2589
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "We can't help."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2591
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You mute them and move on. It's not like Acidic Growth can die of lack of "
"air anyway."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2593
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2597
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2605
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Turns out, there was no risk involved: the ship is full of oxygen. You are "
"confused, but that's when you remember Acidic Growth usually outfits its "
"ships with life support system that spreads the Growth throughout the ship "
"instead of breathable air. Feeling stupid, you consider your options."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2607
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Try reconfiguring it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2611
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_AUG_OE_ACID_FILTER\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Filtering System) Suggest they copy yours."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2613
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_AUG_OE_ACID_FILTER\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they don't show it. While carrying over "
"the changes, one of the Workers decides to stick with you, seeing your "
"system functions perfectly. When the Growth is done, you receive your "
"promised reward, too."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2614
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_AUG_OE_ACID_FILTER\"]/event/crewMember"
msgstr "Acidic Worker"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2620
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Growth Crew) Send over your Acidic crew to reconfigure it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2622
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crewmember, being of Acidic Growth origin themselves, is familiar with "
"this tech, and reconfigures it swiftly. If the Acidic Growth are grateful, "
"they don't show it; you receive your promised reward and they silently fly "
"away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2628
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_ENGI\"]/text"
msgstr "(Engi Crew) Send your Engi to reconfigure it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2630
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_ENGI\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your Engi knows just about everything there is to know about technology like"
" this, and reconfigures it swiftly. If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they "
"don't show it; you receive your promised reward and they silently fly away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2636
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"human_engineer\"]/text"
msgstr "(Engineer Crew) Send your Engineer to reconfigure it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2638
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"human_engineer\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your Engineer studied all forms of life support technology, and so "
"reconfigures it swiftly. If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they don't show "
"it; you receive your promised reward and they silently fly away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2644
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"human_technician\"]/text"
msgstr "(Technician Crew) Send your Technician to reconfigure it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2646
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"human_technician\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"There's next to nothing a WI Technician can't fix when it comes to systems, "
"and so they reconfigure it swiftly. If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they "
"don't show it; you receive your promised reward and they silently fly away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2652
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"shell_mechanic\"]/text"
msgstr "(Shell Mechanic Crew) Send your Shell Mechanic to reconfigure it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2654
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"shell_mechanic\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"While Shell Mechanics are more known for their nanites, it doesn't mean they"
" don't have a bunch of general knowledge. They reconfigure the life support "
"swiftly. If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they don't show it; you receive "
"your promised reward and they silently fly away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2660
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OE_BIRD\"]/text"
msgstr "(Gi Crew) Send your Gi to reconfigure it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2662
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OE_BIRD\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Gi know about all sorts of technology, not just drones. They reconfigure the"
" life support swiftly. If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they don't show "
"it; you receive your promised reward and they silently fly away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2668
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[9]/text"
msgstr "Apologize and move on."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2670
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[9]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide to not mess with their life support system."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2672
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[9]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2676
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_CHOICE\"]/choice[9]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2689
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_SUCCESS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You and your crew mess with life support for a bit and somehow manage to "
"make it work! If the Acidic Growth are grateful, they don't show it; you "
"receive your promised reward and they silently fly away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2695
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_DISTRESS_BROKEN_O2_FAIL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"All your attempts to make life support spread the Growth end in failure, and"
" you even manage to break it fully! Now with O2 levels dropping, you have no"
" choice but abandon the task. The Acidic Growth doesn't seem mad, but you "
"probably should jump away from this beacon while they still process this."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2700
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The origin of distress signal here is an Acidic Vessel in perfect condition."
" Acidic Growth usually sticks to their nebulae, so one of them staying at a "
"clear beacon for prolonged period of time is indeed weird."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2702
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hail them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2704
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "Acidic Growth responds. \"Hello. Outsider.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2706
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Why the distress beacon?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2708
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Oh. We are not in distress. It is.\" An Acidic Soldier brings a shaking "
"Vampweed on screen. \"Rescued, that one. Strange ally, orchid with teeth. "
"Please accept. We don't want it.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2710
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "We'll take them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2712
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Gratitude.\" The moment the Vampweed steps onto your ship, they finally "
"stop shaking, slumping from relief. \"Thankyouthankyouthankyou! I was so "
"scared they were gonna figure out I'm not a greenleaf. No idea what would "
"happen to me! I'm glad you found me when you did.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2717
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "We don't want it either."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2719
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic captain isn't surprised. \"Not equipped, to quell distress? "
"Understandable. We'll wait, for another ship.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2727
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Not your problem."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2729
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide to move on. Someone else will help them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2731
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2735
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_DISTRESS_VAMPWEED\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2745
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr ""
"An unvisited location. This beacon is located within the Acidic Growth, "
"which may be detrimental to the health of your ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2746
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2747
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2752
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The distress beacon here leads you to a roughed-up Orchid vessel. Orchids "
"are the first and, so far, only race that is allied with Acidic Growth. "
"Still, they prefer to communicate with contained Growth, not the acidic "
"clouds themselves."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2754
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hail them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2756
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You try to hail them several times, but they stay silent; maybe their "
"communications are broken? You could try docking with the ship's cargo hold "
"and proceed from there."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2758
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Dock."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2760
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"When you dock, you realize the damage Orchid ship sustained is vastly above "
"what you imagined; acidic gases couldn't have done it on their own. The ship"
" is basically dissolving, creaking under pressure. You'll have to be fast if"
" you want to save anyone - if there's anyone left."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2762
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Try using shipwide comms."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2764
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"No matter what you try, comms don't seem to work. That's when you hear "
"banging from one of the crates."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2766
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Open the crate."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2768
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"A tattered Orchid falls out. Before you can suggest medical help, she starts"
" signing frantically. \"Please, please, help - I hid in the crate in hopes "
"of surviving should the ship get destroyed. But everyone else, they - they "
"are on the bridge, and the hallway to it is rid with holes, which get bigger"
" and bigger. Their oxygen rate can't compete with it. Please, save them.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2770
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"Sending your breathing crew to the bridge would be straight up killing them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2774
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"BLUELIST_CREW_NO2\"]/text"
msgstr "(Anaerobic Crew) Send your anaerobic crew to try repair breaches."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2778
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"BLUELIST_DRONES_REPAIR_CREW\"]/text"
msgstr "(Maintenance Drone) Send your drone to repair breaches."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2780
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"BLUELIST_DRONES_REPAIR_CREW\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The drone speeds past you into the hallway, repairing breaches as fast as it"
" can. While acidic gases keep eating away at the hull, it gets patched up "
"enough for Orchids to traverse from the bridge to the cargo hold. You get to"
" evacuate everyone before moving away from the doomed vessel, as you see it "
"buckle under pressure. You promise to drop off everyone at the closest "
"station, but the Orchid you first met volunteers to serve on your ship out "
"of gratitude."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2786
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"LIST_UPG_SEALANT\"]/text"
msgstr "(Breach Sealant) Release nano-bots into the ship to repair breaches."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2788
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"LIST_UPG_SEALANT\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The nano-bots fill up the hallway, repairing breaches as fast as they can. "
"While acidic gases keep eating away at the hull, it gets patched up enough "
"for Orchids to traverse from the bridge to the cargo hold. You get to "
"evacuate everyone before moving away from the doomed vessel, as you see it "
"buckle under pressure. You promise to drop off everyone at the closest "
"station, but the Orchid you first met volunteers to serve on your ship out "
"of gratitude."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2794
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "We can't help."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2796
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[5]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Orchid, dejected, follows you onboard. Just as you move away from the "
"vessel, it buckles under pressure, the bridge exploding into countless "
"pieces of glass and titanwood, sending the remaining crew flying into space."
" It's terrific, but you can't do anything. You promise to drop the Orchid "
"off at the closest station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2806
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Too risky. Move on."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2808
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide to move on before you meet the same fate."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2814
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Ignore them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2816
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_ORCHID_DISTRESS_PRESSURE\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide to move on before you meet the same fate."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2827
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_ORCHID_PRESSURE_ANAEROBIC_SUCCESS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your anaerobic crewmember works fast, and, miraculously, manages to sustain "
"the oxygen in the hallway enough for Orchids to evacuate! Everyone gets on "
"your ship and you move away from the doomed vessel, seeing it buckle under "
"pressure. You promise to drop everyone off at the closest station, but the "
"Orchid you first met volunteers to serve on your ship out of gratitude."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2833
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_ORCHID_PRESSURE_ANAEROBIC_FAILURE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your anaerobic crewmember tries as they might, but, in the middle of "
"patching up the hull, the vessel buckles under pressure, the bridge "
"exploding into countless pieces of glass and titanwood, sending the "
"remaining crew flying into space. You manage to save the Orchid you met and "
"your stranded crewmember, but everyone else has been lost. You promise to "
"drop the Orchid off at the closest station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2851
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr ""
"An unvisited location. This beacon is located within the Acidic Growth, "
"which may be detrimental to the health of your ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2852
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2853
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2859
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon face to face with an Elite Acidic vessel. They "
"don't appear to react to your arrival."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2862
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hail the vessel."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2864
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic Growth explains that they're hunting a vessel trespassing in "
"their territory. This one ship has managed to evade their capture 3 times "
"now. They hope that you may be able to track the ship down. If you succeed, "
"there will be a reward waiting for you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2866
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Agree to hunt down the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2868
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Despite also technically being a trespasser, clearly the Acidic Growth cares"
" much more about dealing with this other ship. They send you the coordinates"
" for the last reported location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2874
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Refuse the mission."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2876
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "The Acidic Growth don't seem to care and cut comms."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2878
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2882
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2890
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Fight the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2892
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"For some reason you have decided to tangle with the Acidic Elite. You hurry "
"to combat positions."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2895
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_CIV\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:2901
msgid ""
