#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3821
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You pilot closer to the planet. As you get closer you manage to make out the"
" crater on the surface, however instead of a crashed star ship you find a "
"strange factory. It appears that something has crashed into the factory, "
"causing the distress beacon."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3823
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Land and explore the factory."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3825
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You wander through the factory. It appears that a battle of some kind once "
"took place here, the walls of the facility are scored by projectile fire. "
"Eventually you find your passage blocked by rubble. There's a passage "
"around, however it's locked behind a security system of some kind."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3827
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Use explosives to blast your way through."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3829
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Continuing on past the rubble, you notice the signs of battle are missing "
"from this part of the factory. Perhaps theres something still alive out "
"here."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3834
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
