#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3876
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Eventually you arrive in a control room of sorts, and in the middle of it "
"you find a single surviving Acidic Soldier. There's something off about it; "
"the normally green Acidic Growth has turned purple. You're not sure what "
"this means, but you go over to make contact anyway."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3878
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Hello?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3880
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Hello. Have you come to: kill us? Gratitude, if not- please spare. "
"Please.\" Your guess has been proved correct: something is off about this "
"Soldier. Is it even a part of the same species?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3882
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "What are you?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3884
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"We're not entirely sure. We were a: part of the Growth. Now we- they, they"
" tried to kill us, our own, they tried- what are we- excuse us.\" The Acidic"
" Soldier trails off for a moment. \"Could you assist? If you can spare us a "
"bit of scrap, we can: repair one of the ships. We'll head to the Core. It "
"must have answers for us. It must.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3886
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Sure. What should we call you?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3888
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Name? Name. This factory was abandoned when we: crashed. We found "
"someone's business card... A name we liked: Bill. Please, call us that. "
"Gratitude: coordinates to Acidic Growth's home- our, our home, is it ours "
"still- see you there.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3898
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Explain that you can't spare that much scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3900
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACIDIC_LEADER_FIND\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Oh. Oh, that's- that's fine, fine, we'll wait- sorry. You can go. We will "
"wait.\" You return to your ship, collecting a small amount of supplies as "
"you leave."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:3911
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_OE_ACID_INVESTIGATE_BORING\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Feeling a strange sense of deja-vu, you pilot closer to the planet. Alas, "
"nothing remains but an empty factory, devoid of life."

