" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Before Bill can realize, they're already outside the airlock. Who knows what"
" exactly turned them purple."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4096
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr ""
"The Core of the Acidic Growth, this is the original location where the "
"Acidic Growth formed, and as such has the highest concentration of Acidic "
"Growth in the sector."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4097
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4098
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr ""
"The Core of the Acidic Growth, this is the original location where the "
"Acidic Growth formed, and as such has the highest concentration of Acidic "
"Growth in the sector."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4103
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived at the Acidic Core, an extremely dense Acidic Nebula where "
"the Acidic Growth originally formed. It's so dense that it's hard for the "
"Acidic Growth to guard it, they do try however."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4105
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Ask Bill how to contact it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4107
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Let me access the comms.\" Bill messes with the console, while you and "
"your crew nervously wait. It almost feels like the Core observes you..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4109
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4111
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Done.\" Bill steps back. The console immediately explodes with hails, "
"consisting of questions, warnings and orders. The Core doesn't like an "
"outsider being near it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4113
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Respond."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4115
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_RELEASE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Core sees your response. A loud, mechanical voice speaks, \"OUTSIDER. "
"STATE YOUR INTENTION.\" Bill asks to let them talk to it on their own. You "
"allow, but have a sneaking suspicion it's not going to go well."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4117
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_RELEASE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4119
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_RELEASE\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Core: we are a part of the Acidic Growth. Turned purple. Being hunted. Why?\"\n"
"\n"
"It all goes silent for a moment. The tension is thick. And then,"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4124
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_RELEASE\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "And then?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4126
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_BOSS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"WARNING: MUTATED STRAIN. WARNING: DANGER TO GROWTH. ORDER: EXTERMINATION.\"\n"
"\n"
"An acidic shot narrowly misses your ship, and you see a massive Acidic vessel barreling towards you. You have to defend yourself."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4132
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_BOSS\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4146
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "We better leave."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4148
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_BILL_CORE\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Despite Bill's request, you decide to leave as fast as possible. They ask to"
" be dropped off on the closest, preferably non-growth controlled, station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4154
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Bill, thankfully not harmed during the fight, dashes toward the console as soon as the battle quiets down. They type, and type, and type. \"It's- it's refusing hails. The Core. We need to talk. We need to know.\" The carcass of a soldier turns to you, and you really wonder what's actually piloting it - because that's the most emotion you ever saw the Growth express.\n"
"\n"
"\"Captain. It said... mutated strain. It said... danger to the Growth. What are we?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4159
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "You are Bill."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4161
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The soldier steps back, as if in shock. \"Yes, it is... the name we chose. "
"We know. But... you don't understand- what are we? We must have a greater "
"purpose. We must be connected to something greater. We can't just- be... "
"something so insignificant...\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4163
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "No life is insignificant. You have a name. That's enough."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4165
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"This is... just a name of some foreman, isn't it. But, you: saying those "
"things. Makes us feel that, maybe: this is okay.\" Bill looks at the "
"console. \"We should move. They might send more guards after us.\" Their "
"finger touches the screen, closing the communication channel, \"We should..."
" think more about this. Meanwhile, do you need: more crew?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4167
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4169
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Gratitude. Captain.\" Bill walks away from the bridge. As they said, you "
"probably should run from this beacon before you get jumped by an Acidic ship"
" again."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4170
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/crewMember"
msgstr "Bill"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4176
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Decline."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4178
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_BILL_WIN\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Bill seems upset, but doesn't protest. You promise to drop them off on the "
"closest station not under Growth's control."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4438
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr ""
"An unvisited location. This beacon is located within the Acidic Growth, "
"which may be detrimental to the health of your ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4439
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4440
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4445
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived at the beacon, one of the few marked locations in Acidic "
"space. This shipyard was where the first Acidic vessels were constructed and"
" today it serves as the main diplomatic quarters between the Acidic Growth "
"and the Orchids. The Acidic fleet is here, and ships seem to move "
"frantically; something's wrong."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4447
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4449
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You get contacted. \"Federation captain? I am Praetor Mn'Akei. Matter's "
"serious, we could use your help.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4451
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Hear them out."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4457
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4459
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You get contacted. \"Federation captain? I am Praetor Mn'Akei. Matter's "
"serious, and while I heard reports about your crimes, right now we can use "
"any help we can get.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4461
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_OE_ACID_SHIPYARD\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Hear them out."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4469
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You listening? Good. Our intelligence gathered that Coalition is about to "
"attack the Shipyard with full force. I'll let, uh, Growth speak.\" An Acidic"
" Soldier appears on screen, \"Outsider. Coalition, goal, Shipyard capture. "
"Fleet, but more. Prototype vessel. Low knowledge, high threat. Ally, "
"continue?\" Acidic Soldier looks off screen, and soon the Orchid returns, "
"\"Yes, that's the report. The mentioned Coalition prototype will be your "
"target. Now, decide, and as fast as you can, if you will help or not. We "
"will supply you with missiles and drones before the battle.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4471
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Agree to help."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4473
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Great, great. But I'll hold my gratitude for after the battle, captain.\" "
"You receive some supplies. Now there's nothing else to do but wait."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4479
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4481
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Coalition fleet arrives, and chaos immediately breaks out. It doesn't "
"take long for you to spot your target: a large, intimidating ship that seems"
" to be leading the assault. The Acidic fleet retaliates, keeping other "
"Coalition vessels busy."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4486
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Move in to attack your target."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4488
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr "The Prototype notices you. This is going to be quite a fight."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4498
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/text"
msgstr "Decline."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4502
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_MAIN\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/text"
msgstr "Decline."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4508
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_DECLINE_GOOD\"]/text"
msgstr "\"I see. Well, I hope we'll manage it on our own. Good luck, captain.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4512
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_DECLINE_BAD\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"I see. Get out of my sight, then, before you get swept up in the fight. "
"With allies like this, I'm not sure we need enemies.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4516
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_WIN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As things calm down, Mn'Akei contacts you again. \"Captain, we offer you our gratitude. My personally, too. It's not the last we'll see of Coalition, but it'll give us time to regroup, and for the Growth to build more ships. It's a shame we don't know how exactly that Prototype ship was made... but we have our spies.\" He looks off in the distance. \"Excuse me. Your reward, now. Growth?\" \n"
"\t\n"
"An Acidic Soldier you saw before appears on the screen. \"Ally. We have, prototype of our own. Weapon. Accept gratitude.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4522
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_WIN\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml:4524
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_SHIPYARD_WIN\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"And, ally. Before you depart. Your help, our vessels, freed up. We, "
"propose support. Take the vessel. Federation, good luck.\""
